Bind Npc 18004 Zone 21

On topics
    If player rebirth level >= 1
        Topic "Rebirth Stat Redistribution" goto event_1010

On event_1010
    Say "Welcome. Would you like to redistribute your rebirth stats? If you are using WAR Premium or Switching Premium, you can redistribute rebirth stats for free."
    Topic "Next" goto event_1011

On event_1011
    Say "If you are using neither WAR Premium nor Switching Premium, fee is 100,000,000 Noah. Would like to continue?"
    Topic "Yes" do
        If player premium == 12 or player premium == 13 or player gold >= 100000000
            Open rebirth reset panel
        Else
            Say "You don't have 100,000,000 Noah. Please re-check your inventory."
            Topic "OK." goto close
    Topic "No" goto close
